OL,3,AStorm Austen brings power cuts and
OL,4,Atravel disruption as more wind and rain
OL,5,Aforecast
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Saturday, Storm Boelo is forecast to
OL,8,Fbring more strong winds and heavy rain.
OL,9,FThe Met Office has put in place an
OL,10,Famber warning for wind on Saturday and
OL,11,FSunday to cover parts of Scotland,
OL,12,Fnorthern England and Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
