OL,3,AMeghan says she was informed about
OL,4,A'disturbing allegations' against her
OL,5,Afather in 2018
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas Markle, who is 82 and based in
OL,8,Fthe US, denies possessing any such
OL,9,Fimages.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
