OL,3,ASeven shot dead by gunmen at church
OL,4,Afuneral in Jordan, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a news conference, Interior Minister
OL,7,FMazen al-Faraya said authorities were
OL,8,Fworking to apprehend the perpetrators
OL,9,Fwhich he described as a "group of
OL,10,Fextremists".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
