OL,3,AFreed US citizen was tortured in
OL,4,ARussian jail, former Ukrainian
OL,5,Aprisoners say
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainians held alongside freed US
OL,8,Fprisoner Stephen Hubbard have said they
OL,9,Fwitnessed him being beaten and
OL,10,Fhumiliated by Russian guards during his
OL,11,Ffour-year detention.
OL,13,FDmytro Khyliuk first met Hubbard at the
OL,14,FNovozybkov prison in Bryansk, not far
OL,15,Ffrom Russia's border with Ukraine, in
OL,16,FSeptember 2022.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
