OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFreed US citizen was tortured in
OL,4,ARussian jail, former Ukrainian
OL,5,Aprisoners say
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We heard it from the guards. They came
OL,8,Fduring inspections and were asking: in
OL,9,Fwhich cell is the American? And then
OL,10,Fthey used obscene words. They
OL,11,Fthreatened him, they mocked him from
OL,12,Fthe first days."
OL,14,FIhor Shyshko also remembers Hubbard's
OL,15,Farrival at the jail and says his
OL,16,Fnationality marked him out to the
OL,17,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
